1
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,460
Seriously? It just started pouring rain!

2
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:09,140
Ugh, tell me about it. This is terrible.

3
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:12,820
Our boxes are going to get soaked, man.

4
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:16,500
We need to cover them. Grab that tarp!

5
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:20,180
Good call. This weather is such bad luck.

6
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:23,600
Let's move faster. We can do this!

7
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,720
This couch is heavier than it looks.

8
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:46,140
My back is already killing me, dude.

9
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:49,560
Watch out for that puddle! Don't slip.

10
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:53,240
Almost lost my grip on this box there.

11
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:56,920
Just a few more big items left inside.

12
00:04:57,620 --> 00:05:00,080
Thank goodness. I'm totally drenched now.

13
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,720
Alright, quick break. I'm freezing and tired.

14
00:08:27,420 --> 00:08:30,660
Me too. My hands are numb from the cold.

15
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:34,080
Why couldn't it have been sunny today?

16
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:37,500
Because the universe hates moving days, obviously.

17
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:41,180
Seriously, this is the worst moving day ever.

18
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:44,860
At least we're almost done, hang in there.

19
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,720
Last box! We finally made it inside.

20
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:52,140
Yes! High five, everybody! You guys rock.

21
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:55,560
Couldn't have done it without you all.

22
00:12:56,260 --> 00:12:59,240
Now for celebratory pizza and some dry clothes.

23
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:02,920
Sounds perfect. My treat for all your help.

24
00:13:03,620 --> 00:13:06,340
You're the best! I'm starving. Let's order.

